    {
      "id": "6a2c9e41-7d3b-4f58-8e1a-2b9c0d4f5e63",
      "name": "Note: Verification",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -260
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 700,
        "height": 200,
        "color": 7,
        "content": "## 1. Meta webhook verification (GET)\nMeta calls this once when you save the webhook URL in the App Dashboard.\nIf hub.verify_token matches YOUR_VERIFY_TOKEN (set it in \"Verify Token Matches?\"), we echo hub.challenge back. Otherwise 403."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "9b4e1f27-3c6a-4d85-b0f2-7a1e8c3d5b46",
      "name": "Note: Messages",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        220
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 1160,
        "height": 140,
        "color": 7,
        "content": "## 2. Inbound messages (POST)\nThe webhook answers 200 straight away so Meta does not retry. \"Extract Message\" drops status updates (sent/delivered/read) and keeps only real messages. The agent qualifies, checks the calendar, books, and the reply goes out through the Graph API."
      }
    }
